[[:db/add "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd" :answer/id #uuid "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd"] [:db/add "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd" :answer/value "3 \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545"] [:db/add "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/choices "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd"] [:db/add "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/correct "541bfba8-dbd2-5692-8400-5c23781bb5dd"] [:db/ensure "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/id #uuid "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2"] [:db/add "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 9 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(x^{3} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 9 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(x^{3} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/answer-fields "0ee87188-29f0-557d-a757-3c404187f545"] [:db/ensure "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "e1dc1856-8570-5f0a-89ab-959e51200fe2"] [:db/add "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a" :answer/id #uuid "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a"] [:db/add "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a" :answer/value "3 \\cos{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/id #uuid "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5"] [:db/add "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/choices "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a"] [:db/add "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/correct "31b78f18-a0fc-53c6-8a7b-11967228cf4a"] [:db/ensure "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/id #uuid "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d"] [:db/add "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 9 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 9 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\cos{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/answer-fields "b261a77b-1cf9-5e4e-aac4-71e2e8a1aec5"] [:db/ensure "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "19d11ce6-4765-5312-9507-03305372084d"] [:db/add "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b" :answer/id #uuid "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b"] [:db/add "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b" :answer/value "- \\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/id #uuid "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9"] [:db/add "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/choices "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b"] [:db/add "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/correct "707ea017-4814-59c8-9a51-54005373d40b"] [:db/ensure "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/id #uuid "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed"] [:db/add "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 2 x \\cos{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 2 x \\cos{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/answer-fields "38ffebb3-bb75-519e-94de-a81686427cc9"] [:db/ensure "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "1ef50331-2222-53a5-a60c-7d970b3c98ed"] [:db/add "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3" :answer/id #uuid "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3"] [:db/add "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3" :answer/value "- \\sec{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/id #uuid "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2"] [:db/add "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/choices "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3"] [:db/add "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/correct "db3231b5-aeed-5602-9be7-1ccd334e5bf3"] [:db/ensure "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/id #uuid "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446"] [:db/add "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 9 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 9 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\sec{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/answer-fields "3bc55393-9d08-5e57-99fa-5252031d3ff2"] [:db/ensure "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "47920ea4-5406-5ed0-8b6f-fa27c6691446"] [:db/add "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca" :answer/id #uuid "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca"] [:db/add "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca" :answer/value "- \\tan{\\left(4 x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/id #uuid "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9"] [:db/add "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/choices "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca"] [:db/add "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/correct "cc63992a-9d07-51c6-9a14-7da8160f18ca"] [:db/ensure "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/id #uuid "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b"] [:db/add "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 12 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=12 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 12 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\tan{\\left(4 x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/answer-fields "43d191ba-9a39-5e10-8346-6d765a976bf9"] [:db/ensure "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "1db3af81-54fc-56f5-90d7-2aef78d7368b"] [:db/add "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489" :answer/id #uuid "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489"] [:db/add "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489" :answer/value "2 \\cot{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/id #uuid "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094"] [:db/add "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/choices "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489"] [:db/add "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/correct "f875e36d-de2a-5736-a342-e3fe9fc5e489"] [:db/ensure "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/id #uuid "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b"] [:db/add "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 16 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x^{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=8 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 16 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\cot{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/answer-fields "bd04cd60-bda3-5cfd-862c-71c2696c1094"] [:db/ensure "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "101b9e2e-a853-5b6d-9dde-606da78be59b"] [:db/add "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae" :answer/id #uuid "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae"] [:db/add "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae" :answer/value "- 2 \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/id #uuid "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec"] [:db/add "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/choices "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae"] [:db/add "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/correct "58bfa3d8-d227-57e9-b82a-fe9da15e43ae"] [:db/ensure "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/id #uuid "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a"] [:db/add "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 18 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 18 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 2 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 2 \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/answer-fields "7adf920c-bfc1-5695-b5d8-9224f28065ec"] [:db/ensure "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "bd8c81ba-30ea-501d-a51f-626a1c33904a"] [:db/add "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9" :answer/id #uuid "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9"] [:db/add "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9" :answer/value "- 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/id #uuid "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1"] [:db/add "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/choices "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9"] [:db/add "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/correct "24cae070-0ed2-546a-b423-db4cc244efd9"] [:db/ensure "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/id #uuid "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03"] [:db/add "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 18 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 18 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x^{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/answer-fields "955fdd38-6ab4-5155-ae93-cec4da8fd5d1"] [:db/ensure "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "bdc9ccb7-c883-51d4-9fec-ab8fe84f9c03"] [:db/add "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613" :answer/id #uuid "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613"] [:db/add "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/id #uuid "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148"] [:db/add "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/choices "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613"] [:db/add "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/correct "51020b2b-4ab2-516a-889d-5cf5b26de613"] [:db/ensure "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/id #uuid "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2"] [:db/add "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 2 x \\cos{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=10 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 2 x \\cos{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/answer-fields "1af47b71-2283-5efc-9ad6-1b3b80bcf148"] [:db/ensure "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "f7b57d6e-64c9-5e9d-9290-4d7d99e4c7f2"] [:db/add "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773" :answer/id #uuid "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773"] [:db/add "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/id #uuid "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48"] [:db/add "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/choices "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773"] [:db/add "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/correct "31949ad0-96b1-58e3-bf6c-53fb4c72e773"] [:db/ensure "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/id #uuid "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0"] [:db/add "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 4 x \\sin{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 4 x \\sin{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/answer-fields "c9bad736-0fce-57a0-af1c-df02f7de5a48"] [:db/ensure "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "b1d33425-3609-51b7-b446-8aaf1d499fe0"] [:db/add "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4" :answer/id #uuid "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4"] [:db/add "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656"] [:db/add "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/choices "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4"] [:db/add "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/correct "f03fa46a-1413-5fca-8b71-a8c0e88b14a4"] [:db/ensure "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/id #uuid "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5"] [:db/add "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 5 x \\cot{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 5 x \\cot{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{5}{4}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{5}{4}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(2 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/answer-fields "2f9c52dc-1a72-5826-9182-f27a0c5f6656"] [:db/ensure "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "9de74302-8fa4-56ae-bdfc-1a0e6cde33d5"] [:db/add "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8" :answer/id #uuid "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8"] [:db/add "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8" :answer/value "- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{6}"] [:db/ensure "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/id #uuid "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2"] [:db/add "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/choices "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8"] [:db/add "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/correct "a7c350d3-cc87-543d-96d5-dac111bb66d8"] [:db/ensure "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/id #uuid "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f"] [:db/add "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 7 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 7 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{6}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{6}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{6}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{6}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/answer-fields "f08cf9d6-984c-5dbb-8482-f0f3c0ba90b2"] [:db/ensure "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "c396d67e-fbe1-5c22-8d3f-5b57601ca92f"] [:db/add "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/id #uuid "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc"] [:db/add "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/id #uuid "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd"] [:db/add "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/choices "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc"] [:db/add "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/correct "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc"] [:db/ensure "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/id #uuid "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255"] [:db/add "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{5}{2 \\sqrt{x}}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/answer-fields "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd"] [:db/ensure "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255"] [:db/add "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f" :answer/id #uuid "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f"] [:db/add "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f" :answer/value "\\frac{\\cot{\\left(3 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37"] [:db/add "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/choices "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f"] [:db/add "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/correct "7d4c1f48-7a70-50b6-8c08-32c76bff5e3f"] [:db/ensure "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/id #uuid "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b"] [:db/add "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cot{\\left(3 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/answer-fields "a6c480ed-e3e4-59ce-90b3-c54c7f7f8a37"] [:db/ensure "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "973e9055-eac7-5fba-b71f-b62daa06bf9b"] [:db/add "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6" :answer/id #uuid "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6"] [:db/add "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6" :answer/value "- 2 \\sin{\\left(2 \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/id #uuid "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f"] [:db/add "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/choices "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6"] [:db/add "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/correct "0decba54-8a07-57e2-ad81-00835ebda0a6"] [:db/ensure "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/id #uuid "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0"] [:db/add "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(2 \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(2 \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 2 \\sin{\\left(2 \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/answer-fields "fbf6a0de-6107-5841-b1f1-711ea3fa9b4f"] [:db/ensure "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "89bdc3ca-86c0-5c17-ac43-fa3e553566d0"] [:db/add "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b" :answer/id #uuid "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b"] [:db/add "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b" :answer/value "- \\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(5 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/id #uuid "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857"] [:db/add "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/choices "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b"] [:db/add "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/correct "d152707d-b92d-593a-a45f-6ff4e9f70d8b"] [:db/ensure "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/id #uuid "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396"] [:db/add "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 6 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(5 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=15 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 6 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(5 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(5 x^{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/answer-fields "c6614455-3b56-5713-b44f-e1f8edfc1857"] [:db/ensure "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "91db11c0-dfd0-57e8-b6ea-5ae92e47c396"] [:db/add "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae" :answer/id #uuid "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae"] [:db/add "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{5}{x} \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/id #uuid "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424"] [:db/add "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/choices "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae"] [:db/add "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/correct "39ffb3ba-b62e-5f11-92d9-7036b34292ae"] [:db/ensure "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/id #uuid "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43"] [:db/add "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - \\frac{2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{5}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{5}{x}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{5}{x^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - \\frac{2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{5}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{5}{x} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/answer-fields "c436089f-aa2c-5f65-881b-e8fb257be424"] [:db/ensure "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "4583bf88-1e2a-5cbe-9d4f-a672a66aef43"] [:db/add "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478" :answer/id #uuid "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478"] [:db/add "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(\\frac{2}{x} \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478" :answer/validate] [:db/add "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/id #uuid "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0"] [:db/add "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/choices "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478"] [:db/add "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/correct "3361d4af-bd2b-5ae9-a120-637e9a9e0478"] [:db/ensure "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/id #uuid "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07"] [:db/add "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(\\frac{2}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{2}{x}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{2}{x^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(\\frac{2}{x} \\right)}}{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(\\frac{2}{x} \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/answer-fields "12bd3826-f8b2-58fe-8161-3fce354addb0"] [:db/ensure "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "1e714881-ee39-59fc-9a3f-3bf6f9cafc07"] [:db/add "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0" :answer/id #uuid "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0"] [:db/add "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/id #uuid "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece"] [:db/add "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/choices "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0"] [:db/add "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/correct "63f21307-c497-5db0-a85c-03c9d51ed1f0"] [:db/ensure "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/id #uuid "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36"] [:db/add "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 4 x \\sin{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 4 x \\sin{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/answer-fields "47dbca7f-63c7-50ca-9696-c48aa1bffece"] [:db/ensure "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "73c5d24b-b081-5013-81bb-38ff31edef36"] [:db/add "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43" :answer/id #uuid "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43"] [:db/add "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{18} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{18}"] [:db/ensure "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d"] [:db/add "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/choices "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43"] [:db/add "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/correct "8ec1ea4d-e5b7-5b15-900d-6b9a8bdc5f43"] [:db/ensure "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/id #uuid "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c"] [:db/add "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{30} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - x^{2} \\cos{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{30} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{30} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - x^{2} \\cos{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{9}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{9}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{18}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{1}{18}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{18} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{18}.\n$$"] [:db/add "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/answer-fields "e8e215fc-d4c2-5cd1-b568-86a3864b9a1d"] [:db/ensure "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "8d3c55dc-1e6c-5a48-93f5-b03770577f5c"] [:db/add "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4" :answer/id #uuid "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4"] [:db/add "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4" :answer/value "- \\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{6} + \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{9}"] [:db/ensure "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/id #uuid "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c"] [:db/add "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/choices "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4"] [:db/add "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/correct "0dc8b030-b1bf-5b26-bff4-f7094c77cbf4"] [:db/ensure "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/id #uuid "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8"] [:db/add "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{3^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{5} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - 5 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(2 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{3^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{5} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{3^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{5} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - 5 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(2 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{5}{6}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{5 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{6}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(- \\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{9}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{6} + \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{9}.\n$$"] [:db/add "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/answer-fields "250cce16-4722-5b76-b45f-f77bd947727c"] [:db/ensure "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "b8e0ec31-d0ce-535f-99ad-9b1b6605c3e8"] [:db/add "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98" :answer/id #uuid "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98"] [:db/add "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{12} + \\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{36}"] [:db/ensure "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98" :answer/validate] [:db/add "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/id #uuid "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824"] [:db/add "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/choices "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98"] [:db/add "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/correct "e9afe3b5-812c-5b18-a488-b9fd11d61a98"] [:db/ensure "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/id #uuid "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7"] [:db/add "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{18} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{5} \\cdot 6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{12}} - 7 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=12 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{18} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{5} \\cdot 6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{12}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{18} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{5} \\cdot 6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{12}} - 7 x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{12}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{7 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{12}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(- \\frac{7}{12}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{36}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{12} + \\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{36}.\n$$"] [:db/add "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/answer-fields "78973ae1-ce69-5f5c-8a3a-6e322d90d824"] [:db/ensure "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "9749bbc3-f1b3-5367-8b91-1569703885d7"] [:db/add "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/id #uuid "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360"] [:db/add "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/id #uuid "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991"] [:db/add "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/choices "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360"] [:db/add "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/correct "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360"] [:db/ensure "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/id #uuid "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366"] [:db/add "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/answer-fields "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991"] [:db/ensure "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366"] [:db/add "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54" :answer/id #uuid "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54"] [:db/add "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{9} + \\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{27}"] [:db/ensure "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/id #uuid "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e"] [:db/add "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/choices "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54"] [:db/add "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/correct "4240a1ff-fa1b-5a50-b86e-727de8a75f54"] [:db/ensure "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/id #uuid "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640"] [:db/add "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{42} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - 4 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=9 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{42} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{6^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{42} \\sqrt[3]{\\pi}}{6}} - 4 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 x^{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{4}{9}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{4 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{9}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{27}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{9}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{9} + \\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{27}.\n$$"] [:db/add "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/answer-fields "b8a9861d-151c-5794-b355-bec1caa4273e"] [:db/ensure "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "a0f9e5be-a771-57c5-a59e-80a712358640"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "1a2d2fed-4e50-5c59-8fcb-86c837a51319"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/cc/cc99ae6cb5fd9b35a4477e9c7ac81f4903f039304271047985aab2c55daf42b6/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186486542 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186486552 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186486555 :question/retired nil true]]
